/v1/","context":{"app_id":3292300,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-3292300","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:53:33Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4765730","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3292300-1846651706692971","game_id":"steam-3292300","kind":"announcement","title":"Beyond the Crossroads: 1.21","summary":"Discover it. Play it again.Discover an activity through its portal during a normal run to unlock it in the main menu.Return directly to basketball, hockey, bowling, billiards, flight, city driving, mountain climbing, the Colosseum or caves.These standalone modes use three hearts instead of a countdown, with increasing difficulty and personal best scores.Each discovery gives you three menu entries. Cracks appear on its tile as you use them. Passing through that portal again during a normal run re","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T22:42:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692971","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3292300-1846651706679141","game_id":"steam-3292300","kind":"announcement","title":"Pick Your Path: 1.16","summary":"Crossroads- Every so often the road splits into a real left or right turn. The two roads do not meet again: your choice shapes the course ahead.- A flag and a sign at each branch show what waits at the end and how dangerous the way is: a card with its rarity shown, a pouch of gold or healing, with one to three spikes for risk.- Bosses, caves and the finish stay on every route, so no path skips the big moments.Route portals- Some stretches end in a mountain pass with two gates side by side. Pick ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T19:58:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679141","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3292300-1846018067934861","game_id":"steam-3292300","kind":"announcement","title":"The Kraken Rises: 1.15","summary":"The Kraken: first boss- Somewhere along the run the sea turns to lava and the Kraken blocks the road. Lava walls close the arena, so there is no running past it.- Its arms slam onto the track. A red strip on the ground shows exactly where an arm will land, 2.5 seconds before it hits. Step out of it, or jump over it.- After a slam the arm stays down for a few seconds. Jump and Ground Slam onto it to cut it off. Touching an arm hurts and pushes you back, so time it.- Lock-on always targets the hea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T22:41:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934861","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3292300-1845383656381053","game_id":"steam-3292300","kind":"announcement","title":"Night Skies: 1.14","summary":"Ground Slam: while jumping or in the air, press Ctrl (X / Square on controller) to slam the ball straight down. Fully rebindable in Settings.New loading screen: a card from your collection takes the spotlight, flips into view and floats under a soft light, with a gameplay tip below it. Tips are available in all 15 languages.Night sky: stars and a glowing moon now appear in the night region. In daylight the moon is only a faint shape.Main menu at night: a calm moonlit scene with stars, the black ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T12:22:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656381053","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3292300-1843481262699600","game_id":"steam-3292300","kind":"update","title":"A Major Overhaul is Coming: Sneak Peek & Demo Update","summary":"We have been working hard behind the scenes on a massive overhaul for Golf-Like, and it's almost time to share it with you.While we are keeping the full changelog under wraps until release, we wanted to share a quick early screenshot showing what’s currently in the works.This major update will be deployed directly to the playable demo before Steam Next Fest, giving everyone a chance to experience the new mechanics, refined systems, and overall improvements firsthand.Stay tuned, add the game to y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T14:25:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262699600","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3292300-1835236783560147","game_id":"steam-3292300","kind":"update","title":"Golf-Like Demo V11.06 Released - Logic & Optimization Update","summary":"A Minimalist Strategy Matrix Driven by Pure Logic.The demo for Golf-Like has been updated to Version 11.06. This iteration focuses on core algorithm stabilization, grid mechanics refinement, and strategic flow optimization.There are no cinematics, no RNG, and no distractions. Your only objective is to decode the grid architecture and compute the most efficient path to success.Key Mechanics in V11.06:Deterministic Systems: Every move is calculated. Success depends entirely on your tactical sequen","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-11T12:06:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783560147","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3292300-1826992588590266","game_id":"steam-3292300","kind":"announcement","title":"200 Playtesters Reached! Playtest Closing on March 23","summary":"Golf-Like playtest has reached 200 participants.Thank you to everyone who joined and tested the game. Your feedback helps shape the final experience and improve gameplay before release.The playtest will close on March 23.If you haven’t joined yet, this is your last chance to participate and try the game before the playtest ends.See you on the course.Sahil Games","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-11T15:02:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588590266","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3292300-1825093633189095","game_id":"steam-3292300","kind":"update","title":"Release Date Update","summary":"We previously announced Q1 2027 as the planned release window for Golf-Like.Due to recent developments affecting the industry and Turkey, we want to clarify that the exact launch timing may shift slightly within that window.This is not a delay and not a cancellation. Development continues actively every single day. We are refining mechanics, improving performance, expanding content, and polishing the overall experience.Our goal remains the same: to release Golf-Like at the right moment and in th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-20T21:52:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825093633189095","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3292300-1823191198607334","game_id":"steam-3292300","kind":"update","title":"Release Date Update: Golf-Like Now Launching May 2026","summary":"We’ve made the decision to adjust the release date of Golf-Like. The game will now launch on May, 2026.This was not a decision driven by missing features or uncertainty. It was a deliberate choice made during late-stage development, after core systems were already in place. As the project matured, it became clear that additional time would significantly improve stability, balance, and overall feel.In recent weeks, Golf-Like transitioned fully to a custom procedural system that replaces the earli","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-31T12:29:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823191198607334","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3292300-1822556746162692","game_id":"steam-3292300","kind":"update","title":"5 Weeks to Go: Core Systems Update","summary":"Development on Golf-Like is moving into a more focused and demanding phase. With 5 weeks left, our priority has shifted firmly toward depth, performance, and long-term playability.Over the past weeks, we’ve been heavily optimizing the game. Instead of relying on a single, static map structure, we developed a custom algorithm that dynamically builds gameplay spaces. This system is still actively evolving, but it already allows us to create more flexible, replayable, and performance-friendly envir","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-23T18:57:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1822556746162692","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3292300-1821288646588804","game_id":"steam-3292300","kind":"announcement","title":"Golf-Like is now on Steam Wishlist & Closed Beta is live","summary":"Golf-Like is now officially available (Wishlist ) on Steam.You can add the game to your Wishlist starting today.At the same time, we have begun distributing Closed Beta keys to a limited group of players.This first beta phase focuses on gameplay feel, performance, and core mechanics.Your feedback during this stage will directly shape the final release.Thank you for supporting Golf-Like from the very beginning.More updates will follow soon.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-13T19:16:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821288646588804","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3292300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:54Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:54Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3292300":"2026-10-26T10:17:54Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3292300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:54Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:54Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:54Z"},"4765730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:54Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:54Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:54Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3292300","app_id":3292300,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:12Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"a414e3ed21867c3bef2a1bb462dfd85c5b6fa2d25b7b2aa77e79e92c5bc06564","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"공이 멈추지 않는 골프 로그라이크. 티에서 날아올라 뒤로 가라앉는 바다 